    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>JVM LineNumberTable attribute.</para><para>The LineNumberTable attribute is an optional variable-length attribute in the attributes table of a Code attribute (4.7.3). It may be used by debuggers to determine which part of the code array corresponds to a given line number in the original source file. See section 4.7.12 of the JVM specification. </para>    </detaileddescription>
